    {
      "id": "ordered-vowel-run-scan",
      "title": "有序元音段扫描",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "在线维护当前非递减段起点与不同字符数。",
      "steps": [
        "start=0,distinct=1,answer=0",
        "i 从一：若 word[i]<word[i-1]，start=i、distinct=1；否则若字符变化 distinct++",
        "distinct==5 时更新 i-start+1"
